# Daily Sales Call Prep — environment variables
#
# By default this agent uses OAuth-connected accounts (Calendar, Email, CRM, Slack, and an optional
# call recorder) and needs NO keys here.
# Only fill these in if your CRM or call recorder requires an API key that isn't handled by the OAuth
# connection.

# Examples (uncomment and set if needed):
# CRM_API_KEY=your-crm-api-key
# CALL_RECORDER_API_KEY=your-call-recorder-api-key
